# Storage Rules

- All retrospective files live under `data/retrospectives/{retroId}/`.
- Use `file-storage.service.js` — no ad-hoc `fs` path construction from user input.
- Validate retro/feedback/action IDs before building paths (no path traversal).
- Prefer atomic write patterns already used in the storage service.
- No database; no cloud storage in core app code (Drive is MCP-only from parent repo).
